{"ts": 0.188273, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSTAGE 4 — GATE\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[36mRecall\u001b[0m (three questions, all three must be correct).\r\nThen a \u001b[36mpractical task\u001b[0m.\r\n", "len": 127}
{"ts": 0.188679, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
{"ts": 0.188739, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[96mQ1: What does \u001b[92mcommand -v vim\u001b[0m print, if Vim is installed?\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 76}
{"ts": 0.188769, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "the path to vim\n", "len": 16}
{"ts": 0.188794, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "  \u001b[92myour answer:\u001b[0m the path to vim\r\n", "len": 41}
{"ts": 0.195901, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "  \u001b[92m✓\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 18}
{"ts": 0.195966, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[96mQ2: What is the difference between \u001b[92m>\u001b[0m and \u001b[92m>>\u001b[0m?\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92myour answer:\u001b[0m ", "len": 97}
{"ts": 0.196009, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "> overwrites, >> appends\n", "len": 25}
{"ts": 0.196045, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "> overwrites, >> appends\r\n", "len": 26}
{"ts": 0.202811, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "  \u001b[92m✓\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 18}
{"ts": 0.202898, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[96mQ3: Why does \u001b[92mvim my notes.txt\u001b[0m open two files instead of one?\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92myour answer:\u001b[0m ", "len": 104}
{"ts": 0.202954, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "because of the space\n", "len": 21}
{"ts": 0.202979, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "because of the space\r\n", "len": 22}
{"ts": 0.210459, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "  \u001b[92m✓\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 18}
